from fastapi import Response

@app.post("/session")
def create_session(response: Response):
    response.set_cookie(
        key="orbit_session",
        value="issued-session-value",
        secure=True,
        httponly=True,
    )
    return {"message": "session created"}
```
The injected Response is temporary: FastAPI copies its cookie onto the final response and still applies any declared response_model to the returned data.
